#%RAML 0.8
title: OneThing API
version: 1.0.0
documentation:
- title: OneThing API
  content: |
    OneThing turns a photo, a link or a picked product into a live one-product shop that takes

    PayPal payments, or a recommendation page that earns referral commissions through Channel3.


    **How a shop is made**

    1. `createShop`: start from a photo, a link, or a Channel3 product. Gemini guesses what it
       is, how it's delivered, the price, a short link and the page design. You get back the
       shop's link name and an **admin token**.
    2. `updateShop`: correct anything the AI guessed, then set `status: live`.

    3. Buyers pay on `https://<host>/<slug>` with PayPal. Sellers read orders and ship them.


    **Auth.** Seller endpoints take the shop's admin token in the `x-admin-token` header, or a

    **platform API key** (`Authorization: Bearer ot_sk_…`) for marketplaces that make shops for

    their own sellers. Buyer endpoints (checkout, access-code verification, downloads) are public.


    **Access codes.** A digital product can unlock an app or game instead of shipping a file.

    Each paid order gets a code such as `K7QF-M2XP-9HTD`; your app calls `verifyAccessCode`

    before unlocking. Raptor Rush on miriogames.com is a live example.


    **Agent-ready.** Every live shop is also published for AI shopping agents: product JSON at

    `getAgentProduct`, and an MCP server at `/api/mcp` with `search_shops`, `get_product`,

    `create_order` and `get_order`. An agent can find and order, but the buyer still approves

    every payment at PayPal.


    All money moves through PayPal (sandbox in this deployment). OneThing never holds card data.
baseUri: https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com
securedBy: []
protocols:
- HTTPS
- HTTP
baseUriParameters: {}
schemas:
- Error: |
    {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#",
      "id": "Error",
      "title": "Error",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "error": {
          "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "field": {
          "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "detail": {
          "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "error"
      ]
    }
- CreateShopForm: |
    {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#",
      "id": "CreateShopForm",
      "title": "CreateShopForm",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "source": {
          "title": "Source",
          "type": "string",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "enum": [
            "photo",
            "link",
            "channel3"
          ]
        },
        "photo": {
          "description": "`source=photo`: the product photo, up to 8 MB.",
          "type": "string",
          "format": "data-url"
        },
        "description": {
          "description": "`source=photo`: a sentence or two about the product. Required if there is no photo.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "url": {
          "description": "`source=link`: a product page, or your own app or game page.",
          "type": "string",
          "format": "uri"
        },
        "productId": {
          "description": "`source=channel3`: a product id from `searchProducts`.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "slug": {
          "description": "The link name you want. If omitted, the AI suggests one.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "type": {
          "title": "Type",
          "type": "string",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "enum": [
            "auto",
            "physical",
            "digital"
          ]
        },
        "delivery": {
          "title": "Delivery",
          "description": "For digital products. If omitted, the AI guesses.",
          "type": "string",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "enum": [
            "file",
            "access_code"
          ]
        },
        "access_url": {
          "description": "Where buyers use an access code.",
          "type": "string",
          "format": "uri"
        },
        "price": {
          "description": "USD. If omitted, the AI suggests a price.",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "shipping": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "stock": {
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "int32"
        },
        "ship_countries": {
          "examples": [
            {
              "Id": "Untitled Example1",
              "Name": null,
              "Value": "US",
              "ExternalValue": null,
              "Description": null
            },
            {
              "Id": "Untitled Example2",
              "Name": null,
              "Value": "CA",
              "ExternalValue": null,
              "Description": null
            }
          ],
          "example": "US",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "paypal_email": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "email"
        },
        "seller_email": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "email"
        },
        "digital_file": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "data-url"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "source"
      ]
    }
- CreatedShop: |
    {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#",
      "id": "CreatedShop",
      "title": "CreatedShop",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "slug": {
          "example": "dragonflight",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "token": {
          "description": "The admin token. Shown once; store it.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "manageUrl": {
          "description": "The seller's private manage page (contains the token).",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "slug",
        "token",
        "manageUrl"
      ]
    }
- ShopUpdate: |
    {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#",
      "id": "ShopUpdate",
      "title": "ShopUpdate",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "slug": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "status": {
          "title": "Status",
          "type": "string",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "enum": [
            "draft",
            "live"
          ]
        },
        "product_type": {
          "title": "ProductType",
          "description": "`referral` only for shops created from Channel3.",
          "type": "string",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "enum": [
            "physical",
            "digital",
            "referral"
          ]
        },
        "price": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0.5,
          "maximum": 10000.0
        },
        "shipping": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0.0,
          "maximum": 500.0
        },
        "stock": {
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ],
          "minimum": 0.0,
          "format": "int32"
        },
        "ship_countries": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "delivery": {
          "title": "Delivery1",
          "type": "string",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "enum": [
            "file",
            "access_code"
          ]
        },
        "access_url": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "format": "uri"
        },
        "paypal_email": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "format": "email"
        },
        "seller_email": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "format": "email"
        },
        "zapier_hook_url": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "format": "uri"
        },
        "in_gallery": {
          "description": "Feature the shop at `/gallery` while it's live. Off by default.",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "options": {
          "description": "What the buyer picks (physical products only), replacing the current options; `[]` removes them. With options, stock is counted per combination in `option_stock` and the shop's own `stock` is cleared. At most 60 combinations.",
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "id": "ShopOption",
            "title": "ShopOption",
            "description": "Something the buyer picks, such as a size or a colour. The shop still sells one product.",
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "name": {
                "example": "Size",
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 20
              },
              "kind": {
                "title": "Kind",
                "description": "`color` shows swatches, and the photo of the picked colour.",
                "type": "string",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "enum": [
                  "size",
                  "color",
                  "other"
                ]
              },
              "values": {
                "description": "",
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "id": "OptionValue",
                  "title": "OptionValue",
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "label": {
                      "example": "M",
                      "type": "string",
                      "maxLength": 30
                    },
                    "hex": {
                      "example": "#14171a",
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$"
                    },
                    "photo": {
                      "description": "Colours: the shop photo (id) that shows this colour. See `matchColorPhotos`.",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "label"
                  ]
                },
                "minItems": 1,
                "maxItems": 12
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "name",
              "kind",
              "values"
            ]
          },
          "maxItems": 3
        },
        "option_stock": {
          "description": "Stock per combination, keyed by its values in option order joined with ` / ` (e.g. `M / Black`). A missing key or `null` means unlimited; `0` is sold out.",
          "example": {
            "M / Black": 4,
            "L / Black": 0
          },
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "int32"
          },
          "minimum": 0.0
        },
        "facts": {
          "description": "Answers to the \"buyers will ask\" questions in `suggestions.missingFacts`. Each becomes a product detail on the page (replacing one with the same label) and drops off the list.",
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "id": "Fact",
            "title": "Fact",
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "label": {
                "example": "Size",
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 30
              },
              "value": {
                "example": "US women's 8",
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 100
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "label",
              "value"
            ]
          },
          "maxItems": 5
        }
      }
    }
- Shop: |
    {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#",
      "id": "Shop",
      "title": "Shop",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "slug": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "status": {
          "title": "Status",
          "type": "string",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "enum": [
            "draft",
            "live"
          ]
        },
        "product_type": {
          "title": "ProductType1",
          "type": "string",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "enum": [
            "physical",
            "digital",
            "referral"
          ]
        },
        "price_cents": {
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "int32"
        },
        "currency": {
          "example": "USD",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "spec": {
          "id": "DesignSpec",
          "title": "DesignSpec",
          "description": "What Gemini designed. OneThing's templates render it; Gemini never writes HTML.",
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "productType": {
              "title": "ProductType2",
              "type": "string",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "enum": [
                "digital",
                "physical"
              ]
            },
            "productName": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "layout": {
              "title": "Layout",
              "type": "string",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "enum": [
                "bold-hero",
                "editorial",
                "minimal",
                "playful"
              ]
            },
            "palette": {
              "id": "Palette",
              "title": "Palette",
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "background": {
                  "example": "#14171a",
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$"
                },
                "surface": {
                  "example": "#14171a",
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$"
                },
                "text": {
                  "example": "#14171a",
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$"
                },
                "muted": {
                  "example": "#14171a",
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$"
                },
                "accent": {
                  "example": "#14171a",
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$"
                },
                "accentText": {
                  "example": "#14171a",
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "background",
                "surface",
                "text",
                "muted",
                "accent",
                "accentText"
              ]
            },
            "fonts": {
              "id": "Fonts",
              "title": "Fonts",
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "heading": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "body": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "heading",
                "body"
              ]
            },
            "headline": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "bullets": {
              "description": "",
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "faq": {
              "description": "",
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "id": "Faq",
                "title": "Faq",
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "q": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "a": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "q",
                  "a"
                ]
              }
            },
            "ctaLabel": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "eyebrow": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "subheadline": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "story": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "details": {
              "description": "",
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "id": "Detail",
                "title": "Detail",
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "label": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "value": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "label",
                  "value"
                ]
              }
            },
            "suggestedPriceUsd": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "suggestedShippingUsd": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "imageAlt": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "heroPrompt": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "productType",
            "productName",
            "layout",
            "palette",
            "fonts",
            "headline",
            "bullets",
            "faq",
            "ctaLabel"
          ]
        },
        "shipping_cents": {
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "int32"
        },
        "ship_countries": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "stock": {
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ],
          "format": "int32"
        },
        "delivery": {
          "title": "Delivery1",
          "type": "string",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "enum": [
            "file",
            "access_code"
          ]
        },
        "access_url": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "paypal_email": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "seller_email": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "paypal_merchant_id": {
          "description": "The connected PayPal account (`connectPayPal`). Sales go here when it can receive payments.",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "paypal_status": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "id": "PayPalStatus",
              "title": "PayPalStatus",
              "description": "What PayPal last said about a connected seller account.",
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "receivable": {
                  "description": "The account can receive payments.",
                  "type": "boolean"
                },
                "emailConfirmed": {
                  "description": "The seller has confirmed their email with PayPal.",
                  "type": "boolean"
                },
                "checkedAt": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "date-time"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "receivable",
                "emailConfirmed",
                "checkedAt"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "zapier_hook_url": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "in_gallery": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "account_id": {
          "description": "The seller account that owns the shop, if it was made while signed in.",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "description": "",
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "id": "ShopOption",
            "title": "ShopOption",
            "description": "Something the buyer picks, such as a size or a colour. The shop still sells one product.",
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "name": {
                "example": "Size",
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 20
              },
              "kind": {
                "title": "Kind",
                "description": "`color` shows swatches, and the photo of the picked colour.",
                "type": "string",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "enum": [
                  "size",
                  "color",
                  "other"
                ]
              },
              "values": {
                "description": "",
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "id": "OptionValue",
                  "title": "OptionValue",
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "label": {
                      "example": "M",
                      "type": "string",
                      "maxLength": 30
                    },
                    "hex": {
                      "example": "#14171a",
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$"
                    },
                    "photo": {
                      "description": "Colours: the shop photo (id) that shows this colour. See `matchColorPhotos`.",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "label"
                  ]
                },
                "minItems": 1,
                "maxItems": 12
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "name",
              "kind",
              "values"
            ]
          }
        },
        "option_stock": {
          "description": "Stock per combination, keyed by its values in option order joined with ` / ` (e.g. `M / Black`). A missing key or `null` means unlimited; `0` is sold out.",
          "example": {
            "M / Black": 4,
            "L / Black": 0
          },
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "int32"
          },
          "minimum": 0.0
        },
        "suggestions": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "id": "Suggestions",
              "title": "Suggestions",
              "description": "What Gemini thinks buyers will want to choose or ask. The seller confirms; nothing is applied on its own.",
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "oneOfAKind": {
                  "description": "A single item (vintage, handmade), so options and stock don't apply.",
                  "type": "boolean"
                },
                "options": {
                  "description": "",
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "id": "Option",
                    "title": "Option",
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "name": {
                        "example": "Size",
                        "type": "string",
                        "maxLength": 20
                      },
                      "kind": {
                        "$ref": "ShopOption#/properties/kind"
                      },
                      "values": {
                        "description": "",
                        "type": "array",
                        "items": {
                          "$ref": "OptionValue"
                        },
                        "minItems": 1,
                        "maxItems": 12
                      },
                      "fromSeller": {
                        "description": "The seller's description or photo named these values; otherwise they're a guess.",
                        "type": "boolean"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "name",
                      "kind",
                      "values"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "missingFacts": {
                  "description": "",
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "id": "MissingFact",
                    "title": "MissingFact",
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "label": {
                        "example": "Size",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "question": {
                        "example": "What size are the skates?",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "placeholder": {
                        "example": "US women's 8",
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "label",
                      "question",
                      "placeholder"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "oneOfAKind",
                "options",
                "missingFacts"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "photo_blob": {
          "description": "Image id for `getImage`. The cover photo.",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "gallery_blobs": {
          "description": "The other photos, in order.",
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "hero_blob": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "hero_status": {
          "title": "HeroStatus",
          "type": "string",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "enum": [
            "none",
            "pending",
            "ready",
            "failed"
          ]
        },
        "hero_error": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "ai_source": {
          "title": "AiSource",
          "type": "string",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "enum": [
            "gemini",
            "fallback"
          ]
        },
        "source_url": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "referral": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "id": "Referral",
              "title": "Referral",
              "description": "A recommended Channel3 product. Buy links are Channel3-tracked, credited to this shop.",
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "productId": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "title": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "offers": {
                  "description": "",
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "id": "Offer",
                    "title": "Offer",
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "domain": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "url": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "price": {
                        "type": "number"
                      },
                      "currency": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "inStock": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                      },
                      "commission": {
                        "description": "Maximum commission rate, 0–1 (0.08 = 8%).",
                        "type": "number"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "domain",
                      "url",
                      "price",
                      "currency",
                      "inStock",
                      "commission"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "brand": {
                  "type": [
                    "string",
                    "null"
                  ]
                },
                "image": {
                  "type": [
                    "string",
                    "null"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "productId",
                "title",
                "offers"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "created_at": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date-time"
        }
      },
